OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThere will
OL,6,Fcontinue to be a mixture of occasional
OL,7,Fshowers through the night, some heavy,
OL,8,Falong with a few clear intervals.
OL,9,FFresh to strong westerly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSaturday:FSaturday will be another day
OL,12,Fof frequent showers, heavy at times,
OL,13,Fand some sunny intervals. A windy day.
OL,14,FWinds and showers easing towards
OL,15,Fevening.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunny
OL,18,Fspells on Sunday then cloudier later
OL,19,Fwith patchy rain. Cloudy Monday with
OL,20,Fpatchy rain. Early rain clearing on
OL,21,FTuesday then sunshine and showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
